<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center">Food Events in <br>de Markthal</h2>
</div><div class="wp-block-paragraph is-style-w-1-2 has-font-serif-font-family text-h2-subheading">
<p class="has-text-align-center is-style-w-1-2 has-font-serif-font-family has-h-2-subheading-font-size wp-block-paragraph">Beleef het live tijdens de foodevents in Markthal!</p>
</div><!--$?--><template id="B:0"></template><!--/$--><div class="wp-block-buttons justify-center"><a target="_self" class="wp-block-button is-style-button-outline-green" href="/events/"><span>Bekijk alle evenementen</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="12" height="9" viewBox="0 0 12 9" fill="none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M1.71875 3.44782C1.16647 3.44782 0.71875 3.89553 0.71875 4.44782C0.71875 5.0001 1.16647 5.44782 1.71875 5.44782H8.23123L6.72091 7.25308C6.36652 7.67668 6.42262 8.30735 6.84621 8.66174C7.26981 9.01612 7.90048 8.96002 8.25486 8.53643L11.1192 5.1127C11.1793 5.04524 11.2307 4.96904 11.2714 4.88546C11.449 4.52194 11.3899 4.07959 11.1134 3.77527L8.25471 0.358354C7.90033 -0.065238 7.26965 -0.121341 6.84606 0.233044C6.42247 0.587429 6.36637 1.2181 6.72075 1.64169L8.23179 3.44782H1.71875Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class="wp-block-group gap-s mt-2xl mb-2xl flex flex-col"><div class="px-8 py-12 lg:px-24 lg:py-32 rounded-t-[100px] lg:rounded-t-[400px] rounded-b-3xl bg-orange-500 text-gray-50"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-0 lg:gap-8"><div class="wp-block-group gap-s flex flex-col justify-center"><div class="wp-block-heading text-gray-50">
<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-gray-50-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-1">Food News</h2>
</div><div class="wp-block-paragraph is-style-w-3-4">
<p class="has-text-align-center is-style-w-3-4 wp-block-paragraph">Elke smaak vertelt een verhaal. Wat is er nieuw op het gebied van food? Waar kan jij je door laten verrassen? Wat valt er in de Markthal allemaal te ontdekken? Lees hier het laatste nieuws en onze foodblogs.</p>
</div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 mt-l mb-l gap-s"><a class="group flex flex-col gap-4 bg-gray-50 text-gray-950 rounded-[24px] overflow-hidden p-6" href="/nieuws/5-tips-voor-een-perfecte-dag-wandelen-door-rotterdam/"><div class="aspect-w-2 md:aspect-w-1 aspect-h-1 rounded-lg overflow-hidden"><img alt="Obba&#x27;s restaurant in de Markthal" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.markthal.nl%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FMH_19-8-24-29-edited-1-scaled.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.markthal.nl%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FMH_19-8-24-29-edited-1-scaled.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.markthal.nl%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FMH_19-8-24-29-edited-1-scaled.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.markthal.nl%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FMH_19-8-24-29-edited-1-scaled.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.markthal.nl%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FMH_19-8-24-29-edited-1-scaled.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.markthal.nl%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FMH_19-8-24-29-edited-1-scaled.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.markthal.nl%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FMH_19-8-24-29-edited-1-scaled.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.markthal.nl%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FMH_19-8-24-29-edited-1-scaled.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.markthal.nl%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FMH_19-8-24-29-edited-1-scaled.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><h4 class="text-green-500">5 tips voor een perfecte dag wandelen door Rotterdam</h4><div class="flex-grow"><div class="text-gray-300 line-clamp-5">Start je wandeling bij de Markthal, combineer bezienswaardigheden die dicht bij elkaar liggen en plan onderweg genoeg tijd voor rust en eten. Sluit je dag af bij de Erasmusbrug voor een mooi uitzicht over de Maas en de skyline.</div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-green-500 hover:no-underline"><span>Lees artikel</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="12" height="9" viewBox="0 0 12 9" fill="none" class="size-3 shrink-0 transition duration-300 ease-in-out group-hover:translate-x-2"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M1.71875 3.44782C1.16647 3.44782 0.71875 3.89553 0.71875 4.44782C0.71875 5.0001 1.16647 5.44782 1.71875 5.44782H8.23123L6.72091 7.25308C6.36652 7.67668 6.42262 8.30735 6.84621 8.66174C7.26981 9.01612 7.90048 8.96002 8.25486 8.53643L11.1192 5.1127C11.1793 5.04524 11.2307 4.96904 11.2714 4.88546C11.449 4.52194 11.3899 4.07959 11.1134 3.77527L8.25471 0.358354C7.90033 -0.065238 7.26965 -0.121341 6.84606 0.233044C6.42247 0.587429 6.36637 1.2181 6.72075 1.64169L8.23179 3.44782H1.71875Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></a><a class="group flex flex-col gap-4 bg-gray-50 text-gray-950 rounded-[24px] overflow-hidden p-6" href="/nieuws/zo-plan-je-een-ontspannen-dagje-rotterdam/"><div class="aspect-w-2 md:aspect-w-1 aspect-h-1 rounded-lg overflow-hidden"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.markthal.nl%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F07%2FSnipsnap-shoot-97-scaled.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.markthal.nl%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F07%2FSnipsnap-shoot-97-scaled.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.markthal.nl%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F07%2FSnipsnap-shoot-97-scaled.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.markthal.nl%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F07%2FSnipsnap-shoot-97-scaled.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.markthal.nl%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F07%2FSnipsnap-shoot-97-scaled.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.markthal.nl%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F07%2FSnipsnap-shoot-97-scaled.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.markthal.nl%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F07%2FSnipsnap-shoot-97-scaled.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.markthal.nl%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F07%2FSnipsnap-shoot-97-scaled.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.markthal.nl%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F07%2FSnipsnap-shoot-97-scaled.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><h4 class="text-green-500">Zo plan je een ontspannen dagje Rotterdam</h4><div class="flex-grow"><div class="text-gray-300 line-clamp-5">Plan een ontspannen dagje Rotterdam met slimme routes, rustmomenten en tips voor eten, bezienswaardigheden en de Markthal als startpunt.</div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-green-500 hover:no-underline"><span>Lees artikel</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="12" height="9" viewBox="0 0 12 9" fill="none" class="size-3 shrink-0 transition duration-300 ease-in-out group-hover:translate-x-2"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M1.71875 3.44782C1.16647 3.44782 0.71875 3.89553 0.71875 4.44782C0.71875 5.0001 1.16647 5.44782 1.71875 5.44782H8.23123L6.72091 7.25308C6.36652 7.67668 6.42262 8.30735 6.84621 8.66174C7.26981 9.01612 7.90048 8.96002 8.25486 8.53643L11.1192 5.1127C11.1793 5.04524 11.2307 4.96904 11.2714 4.88546C11.449 4.52194 11.3899 4.07959 11.1134 3.77527L8.25471 0.358354C7.90033 -0.065238 7.26965 -0.121341 6.84606 0.233044C6.42247 0.587429 6.36637 1.2181 6.72075 1.64169L8.23179 3.44782H1.71875Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></a><a class="group flex flex-col gap-4 bg-gray-50 text-gray-950 rounded-[24px] overflow-hidden p-6" href="/nieuws/juli-in-de-markthal/"><div class="aspect-w-2 md:aspect-w-1 aspect-h-1 rounded-lg overflow-hidden"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.markthal.nl%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F07%2FMarkthal_Zomercampagne-2026_DPGmedia_1080x1080pix_JUN_V01-slide01.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.markthal.nl%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F07%2FMarkthal_Zomercampagne-2026_DPGmedia_1080x1080pix_JUN_V01-slide01.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.markthal.nl%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F07%2FMarkthal_Zomercampagne-2026_DPGmedia_1080x1080pix_JUN_V01-slide01.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.markthal.nl%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F07%2FMarkthal_Zomercampagne-2026_DPGmedia_1080x1080pix_JUN_V01-slide01.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.markthal.nl%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F07%2FMarkthal_Zomercampagne-2026_DPGmedia_1080x1080pix_JUN_V01-slide01.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.markthal.nl%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F07%2FMarkthal_Zomercampagne-2026_DPGmedia_1080x1080pix_JUN_V01-slide01.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.markthal.nl%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F07%2FMarkthal_Zomercampagne-2026_DPGmedia_1080x1080pix_JUN_V01-slide01.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.markthal.nl%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F07%2FMarkthal_Zomercampagne-2026_DPGmedia_1080x1080pix_JUN_V01-slide01.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.markthal.nl%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F07%2FMarkthal_Zomercampagne-2026_DPGmedia_1080x1080pix_JUN_V01-slide01.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><h4 class="text-green-500">Juli in de markthal</h4><div class="flex-grow"><div class="text-gray-300 line-clamp-5">Juli in de Markthal: op wereldreis in Rotterdam! Juli in de Markthal voelt als een kleine wereldreis midden in Rotterdam. Terwijl boven het grootste kunstwerk van Europa je blik omhoog trekt, ontdek je daaronder nieuwe smaken, culturen en verhalen die je meenemen naar alle windstreken. Deze zomer ligt die ontdekking dichterbij dan ooit: van wereldse gerechten en gezonde [&hellip;]</div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-green-500 hover:no-underline"><span>Lees artikel</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="12" height="9" viewBox="0 0 12 9" fill="none" class="size-3 shrink-0 transition duration-300 ease-in-out group-hover:translate-x-2"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M1.71875 3.44782C1.16647 3.44782 0.71875 3.89553 0.71875 4.44782C0.71875 5.0001 1.16647 5.44782 1.71875 5.44782H8.23123L6.72091 7.25308C6.36652 7.67668 6.42262 8.30735 6.84621 8.66174C7.26981 9.01612 7.90048 8.96002 8.25486 8.53643L11.1192 5.1127C11.1793 5.04524 11.2307 4.96904 11.2714 4.88546C11.449 4.52194 11.3899 4.07959 11.1134 3.77527L8.25471 0.358354C7.90033 -0.065238 7.26965 -0.121341 6.84606 0.233044C6.42247 0.587429 6.36637 1.2181 6.72075 1.64169L8.23179 3.44782H1.71875Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></a></div><div class="wp-block-buttons"><a target="_self" class="wp-block-button is-style-button-solid-white-orange" href="/nieuws/"><span>Bekijk al het nieuws</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="12" height="9" viewBox="0 0 12 9" fill="none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M1.71875 3.44782C1.16647 3.44782 0.71875 3.89553 0.71875 4.44782C0.71875 5.0001 1.16647 5.44782 1.71875 5.44782H8.23123L6.72091 7.25308C6.36652 7.67668 6.42262 8.30735 6.84621 8.66174C7.26981 9.01612 7.90048 8.96002 8.25486 8.53643L11.1192 5.1127C11.1793 5.04524 11.2307 4.96904 11.2714 4.88546C11.449 4.52194 11.3899 4.07959 1